      "value": "Duplicate of an issue reported in comments (merged): https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1878-inviting-a-user-back-to-an-instance-they-were-previously-in-will-result-in\n\nAlso a duplicate of: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/unable-to-invite-people-into-a-group\n\nThis can also occur on `Build 1867`, it's not UI related.",
